  "body": "Step 3.3 of [scroll to the fragment](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#scroll-to-the-fragment-identifier) algorithm says that:\r\n\r\n> Use the [scroll an element into view](https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view/#scroll-an-element-into-view) algorithm to scroll _target_ into view, with the _align to top flag_ set.\r\n\r\nAlign to top flag no longer exists in CSSOM View specification. The arguments should be 'with the _behavior_ being `\"auto\"`, the _block_ being `\"start\"`, and the _inline_ being `\"nearest\"`' (the same as default behavior of [`scrollIntoView`](https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view-1/#dom-element-scrollintoview) method).",
